      "message": "Mixing options with preparers can be a bit over complicated here. options are keyval pair, while preparers are a list of classes. Maybe we can have a special key for preparers like prefixing keys with \"target_preparer_\", e.g.,\ntarget_preparer_1: class1\ntarget_preparer_2: class2\n\ncreate a map of target preparer with unique keys is a bit messy.\nDo you know if there is a cleaner way to do that in go?",
