      "writtenOn": "2019-06-13T20:12:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Something like:\n\ntype Config interface {\n    Config() string\n}\n\ntype Option struct {\n    Name string\n    Value string\n}\n\nvar _ Config \u003d Option{}\n\nfunc (o Option) Config() string {\n    return fmt.Sprintf(`\u003coption name\u003d\"%s\" value\u003d\"%s\" /\u003e`, o.Name, o.Value)\n}\n\ntype Preparer struct {\n    Class string\n}\n\nvar _ Config \u003d Preparer{}\n\nfunc (p Preparer) Config() string {\n    fmt.Sprintf(`\u003ctarget_preparer class\u003d\"%s\" /\u003e`, p.Class)\n}\n\n\nThen replace optionsMap map[string]string with config []Config, and have the caller do:\n\nvar config []tradefed.Config\nif Require_root {\n    config \u003d append(config, tradefed.Preparer{\".RootPreparer\"})\n}",
